# A Today entry moved to the top keeps its place after leaving the view and coming back.
file <<END
- A @due({today})
- B @due({today})
- C @due({today})
END
keys gt G <A-k> <A-k>
see ▌ - C
keys W
hide - C
keys gh G {
see - C
keys gt gg
see ▌ - C
quit
saved <<END
- A @due({today})
- B @due({today})
- C @due({today})
END
